  "lastName": "Samal",
  "overview": "My research focuses on determining the mechanistic roles of glycans in neuroimmune modulation in CNS disorders and the development of biomaterial interventions to modulate the neuro-immune glycome using in vitro assays and rodent models. Glycans play a very important role in modulating inter- and intra-cellular interactions that can decide the outcomes in several neurological disorders. In our lab, we look at the mechanisms to leverage these cues to promote a pro-regenerative tissue response in neurological disorders.",
